---
layout: base.njk
title: Home
---

<p>{{ site.description }}</p>

<p>
  Edit this page at <code>src/index.njk</code>, or open
  <a href="/admin/">the CMS</a> and edit the site without touching code.
</p>

<h2>Posts</h2>

<ul>
  {% for post in collections.posts %}
    <li>
      <a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a>
      — <small>{{ post.data.date | readableDate }}</small>
    </li>
  {% else %}
    <li>No posts yet. Add one in <code>src/posts/</code> or through the CMS.</li>
  {% endfor %}
</ul>

<h2>What is wired up</h2>

<div style="--d:grid; --g:1rem; --gtc-md:1fr 1fr; --mt:1rem">
  <div>
    <h3>Eleventy</h3>
    <p>Markdown and Nunjucks in, static HTML out. No client framework.</p>
  </div>
  <div>
    <h3>Decap CMS</h3>
    <p>Forms at <code>/admin</code>. Every save is a git commit.</p>
  </div>
  <div>
    <h3>startr.style</h3>
    <p>Layout through inline <code>--prop</code> attributes, mobile-first.</p>
  </div>
  <div>
    <h3>Startr Swap</h3>
    <p>Links swap in place. One script tag, one attribute.</p>
  </div>
</div>
